                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Groundwater nitrate removal in riparian buffer zones: a review of research progress in the past 20 years</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2019-05-02">02 May 2019</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers c-article-identifiers--cite-list">
                        
